/* Export: PalSpriteMoveOffsetPos. Adds wrapping 32-bit integer deltas to draw offsets. Null returns 0/error 6. Sprite is borrowed and writable during the call. Success returns 1/error 0. Portable handles are typed arena keys rather than native addresses. Native float-to-integer conversion returns INT_MIN for NaN and out-of-range values; integer priority/offset addition wraps. */
