/* Export: PalSpriteHit. Borrows nullable sprite; null returns 0/error 6. Hidden sprites return 0. The half-open rectangle uses wrapping x/y minus integer offsets plus CVTTSS2SI position, and selected source-rectangle width/height. Ignores scale, rotation, center offsets and modulation alpha. Any nonzero alpha_test samples the selected source texel and returns whether alpha is nonzero. Pixel lookup failure, absent texture or out-of-range source coordinates yields 0xFFFFFFFF and therefore accepts the hit. The EXE/button caller supplies its own flag-to-alpha_test conversion. The typed arena adapter applies already-scheduled action position deltas and preserves the fail-open missing-texture behavior; it does not simulate GPU lock failures. */
